    {
      "slug": "gram:n3-maru-de-you",
      "variants": [],
      "steps_unavailable": "Circumfix around an obligatory pre-posed adverb: まるで opens and ようだ / ように closes, and the record states that まるで used alone is incomplete. The closed op set has append and no prepend, so any ordered sequence from a single base could only emit the closing half — 学生のようだ, 書くようだ — which is the plain ようだ conjecture point, a DIFFERENT meaning this same record explicitly warns against confusing with the まるで simile. Emitting it under this label would teach the wrong pattern.",
      "nuance_tags": [
        "comparison",
        "emphasis"
      ],
      "usage_contexts": [
        "spoken",
        "written",
        "literary"
      ]
    },
